msgid "Blocking internet: your access has been revoked after repeated abuse reports about a forwarded port. You can contest this at %(url)s"
msgstr "正在封鎖網路：由於轉發連接埠遭反覆檢舉濫用，您的存取權已遭撤銷。您可以在 %(url)s 提出申訴"

msgctxt "forum-activity-view"
msgid "%(actor)s liked your post"
msgstr "%(actor)s 讚了你的貼文"

msgctxt "forum-activity-view"
msgid "%(actor)s linked to your post"
msgstr "%(actor)s 連結了你的貼文"

msgctxt "forum-activity-view"
